* [Account-level OAuth apps](/docs/iam/oauth-apps/account-oauth-apps.md): Learn how to create, manage, and rotate secrets for account-level OAuth apps in Twilio. Account OAuth apps use the OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials grant type.
