* [Modify Calls In Progress](/docs/voice/tutorials/how-to-modify-calls-in-progress.md): Learn how to use Twilio Programmable Voice to modify live phone calls and manage call states.
* [Record Phone Calls](/docs/voice/tutorials/how-to-record-phone-calls.md): Learn to record inbound and outbound calls with Twilio Programmable Voice using Python, Node.js, PHP, C#, Java, and Ruby.
* [Respond to Incoming Phone Calls](/docs/voice/tutorials/how-to-respond-to-incoming-phone-calls.md): Respond to incoming phone calls with Twilio Programmable Voice by handling incoming webhooks with TwiML responses for voice apps and notifications.
* [Retrieve call logs](/docs/voice/tutorials/how-to-retrieve-call-logs.md): Retrieve call logs using Twilio Programmable Voice to monitor incoming and outgoing call activity, filter call records, and troubleshoot call issues.
