* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Hangup>](/docs/voice/twiml/hangup.md): Twilio TwiML Voice \<Hangup> reference documentation to programmatically end a call.
* [TwiML™ for Programmable Voice](/docs/voice/twiml.md): Twilio TwiML for Programmable Voice reference documentation to learn how to use markup language instructions to control voice application calls.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Number>](/docs/voice/twiml/number.md): Twilio TwiML Voice \<Number> reference documentation to specify a phone number to dial using the \<Dial> verb.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Pause>](/docs/voice/twiml/pause.md): Twilio TwiML Voice \<Pause> reference documentation to programmatically introduce silent waits during a phone call.
