* [Pay Connectors](/docs/voice/twiml/pay/pay-connectors.md): Learn about Pay Connectors, what products support it, and how to install and configure one.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Play>](/docs/voice/twiml/play.md): Twilio TwiML Voice \<Play> reference documentation to play audio files or stream custom audio back to callers.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Queue>](/docs/voice/twiml/queue.md): Twilio TwiML Voice \<Queue> reference documentation to dial a queue and connect callers using the \<Dial> verb.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Record>](/docs/voice/twiml/record.md): Reference documentation for the Twilio Voice TwiML \<Record> verb to record and transcribe live audio in your applications.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Recording>](/docs/voice/twiml/recording.md): Reference documentation for the Twilio Voice TwiML \<Recording> noun used to start and configure call audio recordings.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Redirect>](/docs/voice/twiml/redirect.md): Twilio TwiML Voice \<Redirect> reference documentation. Learn how to programmatically transfer call control to a different URL.
* [TwiML™ Voice: \<Refer>](/docs/voice/twiml/refer.md): Twilio TwiML Voice \<Refer> reference documentation. Instruct Twilio to programmatically initiate a SIP transfer toward your infrastructure.
